-- Smash history: more Brawl majors' sets, 2010-2012, read by hand from Liquipedia's bracket pages (round 734's way;
-- Matthew, 2026-11-22: "Continue"). Liquipedia keeps the later rounds of most of these brackets, not every set;
-- scores as it lists them; forfeits and DQs left out. Made with tools/liquipedia/bracket-to-sql.mjs from
-- tools/liquipedia/brackets/2010-2012-brawl.txt. Safe to run twice.

-- manual/2012-apex-2012 (brawl): 124 sets, from https://liquipedia.net/smash/Apex/2012/Brawl/Singles_Bracket
on conflict (set_id) do update set round = excluded.round, sort_order = excluded.sort_order, p1_name = excluded.p1_name,
  p1_score = excluded.p1_score, p2_name = excluded.p2_name, p2_score = excluded.p2_score, winner = excluded.winner;

